<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold Flight</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: none
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold flight &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast hold flight</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>With a swift move of the left hand the caster sends a small jolt at 
someone who is fighting. From then on, every time they try to flee, a 
strange power holds them back. It lasts until they stop fighting; then a 
yellow aura around them fades away.
</p><p>It can be cast while fighting. It only works on someone in a fight, and 
not on yourself. The target 
resists with their mind, and the spell may fail. It isn't an attack, so it 
starts no fight of its own. No guild or teacher teaches it, but magic equipment among random treasure can 
raise your skill in it.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>